  keywords = {Actins,Actins: metabolism,Animals,Cytoskeleton,Cytoskeleton: metabolism,Diet,Glucose,Glucose Tolerance Test,Glucose: metabolism,Glucose: pharmacology,Homeostasis,Homeostasis: drug effects,Homeostasis: physiology,Immunohistochemistry,Insulin,Insulin: metabolism,Insulin: secretion,Islets of Langerhans,Islets of Langerhans: drug effects,Islets of Langerhans: metabolism,Islets of Langerhans: secretion,Male,Mice,Mice Knockout,Microscopy Electron,Obesity,Obesity: genetics,Obesity: metabolism,Phosphotransferases (Alcohol Group Acceptor),Phosphotransferases (Alcohol Group Acceptor): gene,Phosphotransferases (Alcohol Group Acceptor): meta}
