  keywords = {ATP-Binding Cassette Transporters,ATP-Binding Cassette Transporters: genetics,ATP-Binding Cassette Transporters: metabolism,Calcium,Calcium-Transporting ATPases,Calcium-Transporting ATPases: genetics,Calcium-Transporting ATPases: metabolism,Calcium: metabolism,Carrier Proteins,Carrier Proteins: analysis,Carrier Proteins: metabolism,Cation Transport Proteins,Cell Compartmentation,Cell Compartmentation: physiology,Endocytosis,Endocytosis: physiology,Fungal Proteins,Fungal Proteins: analysis,Fungal Proteins: genetics,Fungal Proteins: metabolism,Gene Deletion,Gene Dosage,Membrane Proteins,Membrane Proteins: genetics,Membrane Proteins: metabolism,Mutagenesis,Mutagenesis: physiology,Phenotype,Plasma Membrane Calcium-Transporting ATPases,Plasmids,rab GTP-Binding Proteins,rab GTP-Binding Proteins: genetics,rab GTP-Binding Proteins: metabolism,Receptors Cell Surface,Receptors Cell Surface: genetics,Saccharomyces cerevisiae,Saccharomyces cerevisiae Proteins,Saccharomyces cerevisiae: cytology,Saccharomyces cerevisiae: genetics,Saccharomyces cerevisiae: metabolism,Sodium-Hydrogen Antiporter,Vacuoles,Vacuoles: chemistry,Vacuoles: metabolism,Vesicular Transport Proteins,Zinc,Zinc: metabolism}
