  keywords = {adenoma,Anthropometry,Body Height,Body Height: genetics,Body Mass Index,Case-Control Studies,European Continental Ancestry Group,European Continental Ancestry Group: genetics,familial polyposis,for an inherited polyposis,Genetic Predisposition to Disease,genetic screening,genetic testing of children,Genome-Wide Association Study,Genotype,Humans,in children,Meta-Analysis as Topic,Obesity,Obesity: genetics,Phenotype,Polymorphism,primary morbidity,Quantitative Trait Loci,Single Nucleotide,Single Nucleotide: genetics,syndrome in which the,testing for polyposis syndromes,the ethics of genetic,Waist-Hip Ratio}
